Chapter: Display

 They were, once: four effect operations with no handler anywhere in the
 tree, so a call to set-pixel type-checked clean and then died at the end
 of emit with CDX2040, an unresolved operation. An implementation writes
 to the framebuffer, the framebuffer is codex.os, and a foreword chapter
 may not depend on codex.os -- so the honest place for them is not here.
 A chapter that wants them cites Kernel chapter DisplayOps and gets
 definitions that paint. A chapter that does not gets CDX3002 on the
 name, which is the truth: it asked for something it did not bring.

 We say:

Section: Definitions

  effect Display where
